[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0010","text":"嘿嘿……今天是生日……\n甜花，升级……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0020","text":"哈哈，真像游戏里的说法啊\n是哪项属性提升了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0030","text":"诶………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0031","text":"甜花＆制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0050","text":"我、我不是故意要让你为难的\n那个……抱歉……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0060","text":"总、总之生日快乐，甜花！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10215002_00_0061","text":"Motion"}]
